\f1\fs22 Initially, Johnny was incredulous that Chanta would be permitted to land on the hover pad at the golf course, but when he watched the luxurious hover-copt swoop in like it could actually be safe to fly in, Johnny was biliously envious. Chanta emerged from the luxury machine and Johnny adjudicated that he should not be allowed within five solar systems of such a show of wealth. Worse, Johnny suspected Chanta\'92s outfit might possibly have been acquired at Floormart.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

